@api = http://localhost:5000/api

### Premium methods
GET {{api}}/premium-methods

### Create premium method
POST {{api}}/premium-methods
Content-Type: application/json

{ "number": "PR-2027", "description": "פרמיה חודשית", "premiumPercent": 5, "calculationPeriod": "month" }

### Metrics of method 1
GET {{api}}/premium-methods/1/metrics

### Field dictionary of metric 1
GET {{api}}/metrics/1/fields

### File structure history of metric 1
GET {{api}}/metrics/1/schema-versions

### Import history of metric 1
GET {{api}}/metrics/1/imports

### Rows: page 1, sorted by department, filtered by status
GET {{api}}/metrics/1/rows?page=1&pageSize=25&sortBy=מחלקה&filters[סטטוס]==פעיל

### Filter options of a field
GET {{api}}/metrics/1/fields/4/filter-options
